# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of what a
# contributor's OS or tool wrote to disk (see #159: a Windows odinfmt run
# committed CRLF into four .odin fixtures, which Linux CI's own LF-only
# odinfmt then flagged as unformatted). `text=auto` leaves git's own
# heuristic to skip real binaries.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Caught by text=auto's heuristic too, but explicit to avoid any doubt.
*.so binary
